#edb/ref 17592186470189} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fd664d00-d639-529d-a5dd-793d6aa1dfaa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469156} {:answer/id #uuid "cda1bb7c-b498-5d5f-a232-2e431d827287" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469157}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cda1bb7c-b498-5d5f-a232-2e431d827287" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469157} :answer-field/id #uuid "e1493005-7319-5887-8360-d89429b14963" :answer-field/key "Integers ($Z$)" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470190}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "39280445-a454-56b4-bdba-1c7ee371d8c7" :question/math-academy-id "q-80331" :question/problem "To which of the following sets does the number $-\\frac{27}{3}$ belong?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "![](images/67/67ef97be4b21a74feaae15f3ff30d5077fc1316874df8de79155316a621e4487.png)\n\nRecall the following:\n\n- $N$ represents the set of **natural numbers**.\n\n- $Z$ represents the set of **integers**.\n\n- $Q$ represents the set of **rational numbers**.\n\n- $R$ represents the set of **real numbers**.\n\n- $C$ represents the set of **complex numbers**\n\nWith that in mind, we note the following:\n\n- The number $-\\frac{27}{3}=-9$ is negative, so it does *not* belong to $N,$ and we can write\n\n$$\n-\\frac{27}{3}\\notin N.\n$$\n\n- However, $-9$ is an integer, so it does belong to $Z,$ and we can write\n\n$$\n-\\frac{27}{3}\\in Z.\n$$\n\n- Every integer is a rational, real, and complex number. Consequently, $-\\frac{27}{3}$ belongs to $Q,R,$ and $C,$ and we can write\n\n$$\n-\\frac{27}{3}\\in Q,\\,-\\frac{27}{3}\\in R,\\,-\\frac{27}{3}\\in C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$Z,Q,R,$ and $C$ only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348365 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0287e786-d236-580b-9444-d30f44500fe3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469158} {:answer/id #uuid "1452ce32-c055-5da5-8242-a6dd44cbabe8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469159}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1452ce32-c055-5da5-8242-a6dd44cbabe8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469159} :answer-field/id #uuid "4c5bf6ea-3b62-5a7e-a810-4b2cb9743b3d" :answer-field/key "Complex numbers ($C$)" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470191} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2bcc843e-d5df-542e-804d-6506118ad688" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469160} {:answer/id #uuid "694526bd-6935-5a17-a8e4-bdfe580f5b96" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469161}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2bcc843e-d5df-542e-804d-6506118ad688" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469160} :answer-field/id #uuid "01e44932-83a3-5394-883f-a9d0d5b322bf" :answer-field/key "Natural numbers ($N$)" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470192} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "75f0fadf-bc35-59ed-8a3a-14114ff4b275" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469162} {:answer/id #uuid "08b1e35c-91bb-56a0-aa1a-e390f93f569d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469163}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "75f0fadf-bc35-59ed-8a3a-14114ff4b275" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469162} :answer-field/id #uuid "0bf8647b-7f21-5d1c-86da-2ff5d0089d4d" :answer-field/key "Rational numbers ($Q$)" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470193} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "687f8064-d19c-5b04-96b5-7a66771814c4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469164} {:answer/id #uuid "f5c28a97-679f-53e1-9f72-90fbf1ccf00b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469165}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f5c28a97-679f-53e1-9f72-90fbf1ccf00b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469165} :answer-field/id #uuid "8df6bed7-94ed-5467-9b40-5bdc5c2235df" :answer-field/key "Real numbers ($R$)" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470194} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e4f23960-532d-56dc-a2f0-3689d73fd744" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469166} {:answer/id #uuid "8756a38a-dd41-5cd2-9f7e-889679dc1f2c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469167}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e4f23960-532d-56dc-a2f0-3689d73fd744" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469166} :answer-field/id #uuid "fb5533c3-5e75-59ef-898a-e61b052fc950" :answer-field/key "Integers ($Z$)" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470195}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "3c87cce5-2762-52a9-b3ea-307f7f887046" :question/math-academy-id "q-80332" :question/problem "To which of the following sets does the number $\\pi $ belong?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "![](images/67/67ef97be4b21a74feaae15f3ff30d5077fc1316874df8de79155316a621e4487.png)\n\nRecall the following:\n\n- $N$ represents the set of **natural numbers**.\n\n- $Z$ represents the set of **integers**.\n\n- $Q$ represents the set of **rational numbers**.\n\n- $R$ represents the set of **real numbers**.\n\n- $C$ represents the set of **complex numbers**\n\nWith that in mind, we note the following:\n\n- The number $\\pi $ is not an integer, so it does *not* belong to $Z$ nor to $N,$ so we can write\n\n$$\n\\pi \\notin N,\\,\\pi \\notin Z.\n$$\n\n- Also, notice that $\\pi =3.14159\\,…\\,$ can not be written as the ratio of two integers, so it does *not* belong to $Q$ either, and we can write \n\n$$\n\\pi \\notin Q.\n$$\n\n- Every irrational number is both a real number and a complex number. Consequently, $\\pi $ belongs to both $R$ and $C,$ and we can write\n\n$$\n\\pi \\in R,\\,\\pi \\in C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$R$ and $C$ only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622936 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "506a3d14-0211-557e-a416-3b84bbb5f071" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622957} {:answer/id #uuid "554bc03a-0e26-5a0b-ba41-13e00d5116e9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622959}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "554bc03a-0e26-5a0b-ba41-13e00d5116e9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622959} :answer-field/id #uuid "44ee2783-210e-5665-8577-9127ca77fa2a" :answer-field/key "Natural numbers ($N$)" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622953} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2e6bc3bd-e28c-5a3a-9c40-fcdd2193e1de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622948} {:answer/id #uuid "7afb12c2-2cc7-5e47-87fa-7cb5c6297491" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622969}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7afb12c2-2cc7-5e47-87fa-7cb5c6297491" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "tru