n\\frac{34}{3}\\in Q\n$$\n\n- Every rational is a real and complex number. Consequently, $\\frac{34}{3}$ belongs to both $R$ and $C,$ and we can write\n\n$$\n\\frac{34}{3}\\in R\\qquad \\frac{34}{3}\\in C\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $Q, R, C$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186622968 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ace9d426-16da-56a6-8983-646e84be21aa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622986} {:answer/id #uuid "ec4ea88d-4c62-51b3-8269-157606516b20" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186623006}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ace9d426-16da-56a6-8983-646e84be21aa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622986} :answer-field/id #uuid "0d01058f-2c3f-52e0-a113-44824b371885" :answer-field/key "Complex numbers ($C$)" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622934} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2e6d8fe0-a124-53ec-9e84-103183f4cbed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622949} {:answer/id #uuid "753fd7a0-dfa0-58c1-b647-d24cb8362342" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622967}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "753fd7a0-dfa0-58c1-b647-d24cb8362342" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622967} :answer-field/id #uuid "19f80db6-3e9b-52f9-9f11-a7f5780fcf3c" :answer-field/key "Real numbers ($R$)" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622937} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7dc0566f-bd53-5b5c-9b83-fdc9ee206608" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186622971} {:answer/id #uuid "83598200-9a8c-573c-899c-e016d9157a41" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :