ield/id #uuid "9b8383e1-b51c-5648-b2c8-9d6292965070" :answer-field/key "Rational numbers ($Q$)" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673705} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b1b4242-f6d8-57e5-b4a1-6a93ebda9747" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673686} {:answer/id #uuid "f4642916-fb8d-5ed9-9e83-dbb02233f519" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673725}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f4642916-fb8d-5ed9-9e83-dbb02233f519" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673725} :answer-field/id #uuid "ef4764ab-77be-5084-8558-7b87cfeb8ae1" :answer-field/key "Complex numbers ($C$)" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186673724}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8" :question/problem "To which of the following sets does the number $\\sqrt{100}$ belong?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "![](images/67/67ef97be4b21a74feaae15f3ff30d5077fc1316874df8de79155316a621e4487.png)\n\nRecall the following:\n\n- $N$ represents the set of **natural numbers**.\n\n- $Z$ represents the set of **integers**.\n\n- $Q$ represents the set of **rational numbers**.\n\n- $R$ represents the set of **real numbers**.\n\n- $C$ represents the set of **complex numbers**.\n\nWith that in mind, we note the following:\n\n- The number $\\sqrt{100}=10$ is a positive whole number, so it belongs to $N.$ We can write\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{100}\\in N\n$$\n\n- Every natural number is an integer, rational, real, and complex number. Consequently, we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\\sqrt{100}\\in Z\\qquad \\sqrt{100}\\in Q \\\\ \\sqrt{100}\\in R\\qquad \\sqrt{100}\\in C\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $N, Z, Q, R, C$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186673